        "semanticLevel": "detail",
        "content": {
          "kind": "html",
          "value": "<div style='container-type:inline-size;width:100%;height:100%'><div style='box-sizing:border-box;width:100%;height:100%;font-family:system-ui,-apple-system,Segoe UI,sans-serif;padding:4cqw;border-radius:3cqw;background:#ffffff;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:2cqw'><div style='display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:baseline;gap:2cqw'><div style='min-width:0'><div style='font-size:2.2cqw;font-weight:600;letter-spacing:.08em;text-transform:uppercase;color:#6d28d9'>Collection</div><div style='font-weight:600;font-size:4cqw;line-height:1.2;color:#0f172a;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis'>Constraints</div></div><div style='font-size:2.2cqw;color:#64748b;white-space:nowrap'>3 graphs</div></div><div style='flex:1;min-height:0;overflow:auto'><div style='display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(auto-fill,minmax(26.2cqw,1fr));gap:1.4cqw;align-content:start'><a href='github://mikemartinez1974/public/why/brainstorm/constraints/ten-minutes/root.node' style='display:flex;gap:2.2cqw;align-items:flex-start;box-sizing:border-box;height:14.2cqw;padding:1.6cqw 2.1cqw;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:2.4cqw;background:#f8fafc;text-decoration:none;color:inherit;min-width:0;overflow:hidden'><span style='flex:none;width:6.2cqw;height:6.2cqw;border-radius:1.6cqw;background:#c2410c22;color:#c2410c;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:600;font-size:3cqw'>D</span><span style='min-width:0'><span style='display:block;font-weight:600;font-size:2.9cqw;line-height:1.25;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;color:#0f172a'>Demonstrable in ten minutes</span><span style='display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden;font-size:2.6cqw;line-height:1.3;color:#64748b'>A use case that needs a long setup cannot be shown to a new user.</span></span></a><a href='github://mikemartinez1974/public/why/brainstorm/constraints/who-in-plain-words/root.node' style='display:flex;gap:2.2cqw;align-items:flex-start;box-sizing:border-box;height:14.2cqw;padding:1.6cqw 2.1cqw;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:2.4cqw;background:#f8fafc;text-decoration:none;color:inherit;min-width:0;overflow:hidden'><span style='flex:none;width:6.2cqw;height:6.2cqw;border-radius:1.6cqw;background:#c2410c22;color:#c2410c;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:600;font-size:3cqw'>S</span><span style='min-width:0'><span style='display:block;font-weight:600;font-size:2.9cqw;line-height:1.25;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;color:#0f172a'>Says who it is for, in plain words</span><span style='display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden;font-size:2.6cqw;line-height:1.3;color:#64748b'>Each use names a person, not a feature.</span></span></a><a href='github://mikemartinez1974/public/why/brainstorm/constraints/honest-about-free/root.node' style='display:flex;gap:2.2cqw;align-items:flex-start;box-sizing:border-box;height:14.2cqw;padding:1.6cqw 2.1cqw;border:1px solid #e2e8f0;border-radius:2.4cqw;background:#f8fafc;text-decoration:none;color:inherit;min-width:0;overflow:hidden'><span style='flex:none;width:6.2cqw;height:6.2cqw;border-radius:1.6cqw;background:#c2410c22;color:#c2410c;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;font-weight:600;font-size:3cqw'>H</span><span style='min-width:0'><span style='display:block;font-weight:600;font-size:2.9cqw;line-height:1.25;white-space:nowrap;overflow:hidden;text-overflow:ellipsis;color:#0f172a'>Honest about what is free and what is paid</span><span style='display:-webkit-box;-webkit-line-clamp:2;-webkit-box-orient:vertical;overflow:hidden;font-size:2.6cqw;line-height:1.3;color:#64748b'>Explore the Twilite Zone for free. Create and manage your own corner of it with the Twilite Editor for $20/month. Bring your own AI agent. No use case should imply otherwise: the Zone is free to explore, the Editor is the paid thing, and the AI is one the customer brings.</span></span></a></div></div></div></div>"
